{"seq":1,"slug":"appointment-window-quota-model","title":"码头预约时段与配额模型：窗口资源、时间片与放号规则的抽象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/port-drayage-truck-appointment-container-dispatch-system/terminal-appointment-window-scheduling/appointment-window-quota-model","wordCount":4077,"readingTime":17,"html":"<h1 id=\"码头预约时段与配额模型-窗口资源-时间片与放号规则的抽象\">码头预约时段与配额模型：窗口资源、时间片与放号规则的抽象</h1><p>集卡司机凌晨四点在闸口外排队等抬杆，是短驳行业最古老的痛点；解决它的工程手段不是&quot;多开闸口&quot;，而是把&quot;到港时间&quot;从一个自由竞争的先到先得，改造成一个<strong>受约束的时间配额资源</strong>。码头预约系统（Terminal Appointment System, TAS）本质上做三件事：把作业时间切成离散时段、给每个时段设定容量上限、再按一套规则把名额分配给不同车队与货主。本文不谈某家码头的界面，而是抽出这套系统的共同抽象——窗口、时间片、配额、放号规则——因为从美西到亚洲枢纽港，实现各异，但这四层骨架是共通的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-预约窗口是一种受约束的时间配额资源\">核心概念：预约窗口是一种受约束的时间配额资源</h2><p>一个&quot;预约时段&quot;（appointment slot）在系统里从来不是一个时间点，而是三元组：<strong>窗口 + 容量 + 约束</strong>。窗口是它可被占用的时段范围（如 08:00–09:00）；容量是这段窗口能容纳多少台车（如 40 个名额）；约束则规定谁有资格占用（哪家车队、运什么货、走进口提重还是空箱返还）。理解这一点就能明白：预约系统不是在&quot;排日历&quot;，而是在做<strong>稀缺资源分配</strong>。</p>\n<p>这套机制的由来有明确出处。洛杉矶港与长滩港的集装箱码头运营方通过 WCMTOA 组建非营利机构 PierPASS，于 2005 年推出 OffPeak 计划，用夜间与周六班次分流车流，费用由交通缓堵费（Traffic Mitigation Fee, TMF）覆盖；2018 年 11 月改版后，OffPeak 的核心变化正是<strong>用预约把卡车到港时间分散到码头整个营业时段内</strong>，且&quot;每个码头各自管理自己的预约系统&quot;（来源：pierpass.org/appointments/）。这意味着工程上不存在跨码头的统一时段表：仅洛杉矶一港，两侧十余个集装箱码头就各有预约入口，部分自建门户、部分接入 eModal 这类第三方平台（来源：pierpass.org、emodal.com）。对车队 TMS 而言，这直接把&quot;预约&quot;从一次操作变成<strong>跨多个异构系统的并发争抢</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[码头发放预约时段] --&gt; B{窗口与容量定义}&#10;  B --&gt; C[时间片: 窗口x容量]&#10;  C --&gt; D{放号规则}&#10;  D --&gt;|先到先得 FIFO| E[即时占用]&#10;  D --&gt;|分批放号| F[配额分批释放]&#10;  D --&gt;|双重交易优先| G[配对双票优先放行]&#10;  E --&gt; H[车队 TMS 争抢]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I{占用结果}&#10;  I --&gt;|成功| J[生成预约凭证 供闸口核验]&#10;  I --&gt;|失败| K[重试或改约]&#10;  J --&gt; L[闸口实际进出]&#10;  L --&gt; M[CODECO 门动作报文回传船公司]\">flowchart TD\n  A[码头发放预约时段] --&gt; B{窗口与容量定义}\n  B --&gt; C[时间片: 窗口x容量]\n  C --&gt; D{放号规则}\n  D --&gt;|先到先得 FIFO| E[即时占用]\n  D --&gt;|分批放号| F[配额分批释放]\n  D --&gt;|双重交易优先| G[配对双票优先放行]\n  E --&gt; H[车队 TMS 争抢]\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I{占用结果}\n  I --&gt;|成功| J[生成预约凭证 供闸口核验]\n  I --&gt;|失败| K[重试或改约]\n  J --&gt; L[闸口实际进出]\n  L --&gt; M[CODECO 门动作报文回传船公司]</pre><p>上图下半段连接了另一个关键事实：预约是&quot;计划&quot;，实际进出闸口是&quot;事实&quot;，两者靠 EDI 报文对齐。SMDG（UN/CEFACT 认可的航运业用户组）的集装箱报文体系中，<strong>CODECO</strong> 用于把卡车/火车/驳船的实际闸口进出报告给船公司，而预约本身并无同级专用报文——COPINO 是提箱通知、COPARN 是订舱，都不等同于时段占位（来源：smdg.org）。这个空白正是&quot;预约&quot;必须由码头侧或第三方平台私有实现的原因，也是 TMS 集成时最难标准化的部分。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念层</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>典型实体</th>\n<th>变更频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>窗口 Window</td>\n<td>哪些时段可被预约</td>\n<td>营业日历、班次</td>\n<td>低（按周/季）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间片 Slot</td>\n<td>某窗口有多少名额</td>\n<td>时段 + 容量</td>\n<td>中（按日发布）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配额 Quota</td>\n<td>名额如何在主体间分配</td>\n<td>车队/货主预留额度</td>\n<td>中（按合同/日）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>放号规则 Rule</td>\n<td>谁先拿到、如何释放</td>\n<td>FIFO、分批、优先配对</td>\n<td>高（可调策略）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预约凭证 Appointment</td>\n<td>某台车的具体占位</td>\n<td>预约号 + 二维码</td>\n<td>高（每票）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>窗口与时间片是资源侧，配额与放号规则是分配侧，预约凭证是结果侧</strong>。多数系统的&quot;规则调整&quot;只动分配侧，资源侧变更需与码头重新协商营业日历；把两者混在一个配置里，是后期无法解释&quot;为什么今天放号异常&quot;的常见根因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时间片建模-把连续作业时间切成可分配离散单元\">时间片建模：把连续作业时间切成可分配离散单元</h2><p>时间片由两个量决定：<strong>片长</strong>和<strong>片容量</strong>。片长的选择是典型工程权衡：太长（如全天一个片）预约就失去分散车流的作用；太短（如 15 分钟）则司机因拥堵晚到几分钟就逾期，重约率飙升。实践中 <strong>1 小时片长</strong>是常见折中，足以把一天车流切成十几个可调度的粒度。</p>\n<p>片容量由闸口服务能力反推。若某时段开放 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个进闸通道，每台车平均闸口服务时长为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（取号、核对、验箱、放行），则该时段理论容量为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>slot</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>slot</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{slot}} = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{N_g \\cdot T_{\\text{slot}}}{t_s} \\right\\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">slot</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">slot</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如 6 个通道、片长 60 分钟、平均服务 8 分钟，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\lfloor 6 \\times 60 / 8 \\rfloor = 45</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60/8</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">45</span></span></span></span></span>。但这是<strong>上限而非应放量</strong>——闸口之后还有堆场作业，若龙门吊或空箱区能力不足，闸口放行再多也只是把排队从门口挪到堆场。因此实际可放名额取闸口与堆场能力较小值再打安全系数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>release</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>slot</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>yard</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>ρ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{release}} = \\rho \\cdot \\min\\left(C_{\\text{slot}},\\, C_{\\text{yard}}\\right),\\qquad \\rho \\in (0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">release</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">slot</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">yard</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>安全系数补偿的是<strong>到达波动</strong>：预约只是&quot;计划到达&quot;，卡车到达在窗口内并不均匀。若到达率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>、服务率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>，系统要多高利用率才不至于队列失控，取决于到达过程有多&quot;抖&quot;，这正是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 的意义。Little 定律给出稳态关系 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 为系统内平均车辆数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 为平均停留时间）；当时段被反复约满、码头又不愿放行无预约车辆时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 会迅速上升——因此核心指标之一是<strong>到达曲线与容量曲线的贴合度</strong>，而非单纯的放号总量。一个易被忽略的细节是<strong>时段边界效应</strong>：相邻两片各自放满时，司机会集中在前一片末尾到达，在边界形成跨片尖峰；缓解手段是让相邻片之间做<strong>背压</strong>——后一片未饱和时允许前一片溢出车辆顺延记账，而非一律判逾期。这也是预约凭证需要携带<strong>可容忍偏倚窗口</strong>（grace period，常见 15–30 分钟）字段的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"配额与放号规则-产能-公平性与反占位\">配额与放号规则：产能、公平性与反占位</h2><p>若时段容量全按先到先得（FIFO）开放，结果往往不是效率最高，而是<strong>最会抢的人拿走最多</strong>：大型车队可用脚本高频轮询接口，中小车队与零散货主被挤出。因此成熟系统几乎都引入<strong>配额（quota）</strong>：把一部分名额按主体预先保留，余量再开放争抢。配额分配常见三类策略：<strong>按规模比例</strong>（预留名额与历史吞吐量或注册车辆数成正比，直观易解释）；<strong>max-min 公平分配</strong>（water-filling，先保证每主体一个保底名额，再把余量按需求增量分配）；<strong>按服务承诺分配</strong>（对承诺高履约率的车队给予更高预留额度，把配额与行为绑定）。</p>\n<p>放号规则则决定名额&quot;什么时候、以什么节奏&quot;放出，核心决策是<strong>全量一次性放号</strong>还是<strong>分批放号</strong>。一次性放号在某时刻（如前一日 17:00）公开全部名额，简单透明但抢号尖峰剧烈、易被脚本占位；分批放号把一天名额拆成数批逐步释放（常把前批未履约名额回收并入下一批），天然抑制尖峰，也给系统在日内按实际到港动态调容的机会。</p>\n<p>反占位（anti-hoarding）是最易被低估的一环。若&quot;约了不来&quot;没有代价，理性主体会多约占位、到时弃约，系统便充斥<strong>幽灵预约</strong>——账面满载、实际空转。对抗手段主要有三：<strong>限额</strong>（单主体在手预约数上限）、<strong>冷却</strong>（取消后一段时间内不得重约同一时段）、<strong>履约率惩罚</strong>（履约率低于阈值时下调其后数日预留配额）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>放号策略</th>\n<th>释放节奏</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全量一次性</td>\n<td>前一日单点</td>\n<td>简单透明、易审计</td>\n<td>抢号尖峰、脚本占位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分批滚动</td>\n<td>日内多次</td>\n<td>抑制尖峰、可动态调容</td>\n<td>规则复杂、需解释单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配额预留</td>\n<td>事前锁定额度</td>\n<td>保护中小主体</td>\n<td>额度僵化、余量浪费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双重交易优先</td>\n<td>配对后放行</td>\n<td>提升双循环率</td>\n<td>依赖配对成功率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>需要强调：<strong>配额不是静态常量，而是随履约行为反馈调整的状态量</strong>。健康系统里配额配置几乎每天被履约数据小幅修正；若一套配额表半年未动，通常意味着它要么过度宽松（配额从不构成约束），要么系统根本没采集履约数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"双重运输与双重交易的窗口耦合\">双重运输与双重交易的窗口耦合</h2><p>预约模型里最特殊的需求是<strong>双重交易（dual transaction）</strong>：同一台车在同一趟进港途中，既完成出口箱送交（gate-in），又完成进口箱提取或空箱返还（gate-out）。它把两次单程压成一次往返，显著降低单车每箱成本与道路车流。</p>\n<p>双重交易对预约模型的冲击在于<strong>它不能简单约两个独立时段</strong>。若进闸与出闸时段被独立分配，司机可能拿到 08:00 进闸票与 11:00 出闸票，中间三小时等待让&quot;双循环&quot;名存实亡，车反而占了堆场通道。因此支持双重交易的系统必须把两个动作<strong>作为耦合的一对时段</strong>分配——这正是&quot;双重交易优先&quot;放号规则的含义。配对成功的条件不只是&quot;两个时段都有名额&quot;，还包含货物侧可行性：进口箱须已完成海关放行与船公司放箱、出口箱须进入可接收状态、空箱返还的目标箱型池须有可用槽位。APM Terminals 在 Pier 400 码头就把<strong>空箱返还可用性按船公司分列</strong>作为独立查询能力提供（来源：apmterminals.com），正说明&quot;还箱能不能还&quot;本身是双重交易是否成立的前置条件。</p>\n<p>配对在数学上是带约束的二部匹配，可用评分函数近似：给定进闸请求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 与出闸请求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，配对价值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(a,b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 由进/出时刻贴合度、箱型兼容度与优先级加权（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>ψ</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V = w_1\\phi + w_2\\psi + w_3\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span>）。配对系统每天在放号前对候选集合批量求解，把&quot;应被鼓励配对的请求对&quot;提前锁定名额。这也是为什么双重交易必须由 TMS 与预约层协同设计：<strong>单看预约接口只有一堆互不相关的时段；只有把货物、箱型、放行状态一并带进配对，双循环才可能被有意生产出来</strong>——这套跨层状态汇聚属于 <a href=\"../dispatch-execution-visibility-exception/\">派单执行、在途可视与异常处置工程</a> 的主题。</p>\n<p>政策侧也有耦合。FMC（美国联邦海事委员会）依据《2022 年海洋航运改革法》（OSRA）持续收紧对滞期费与滞箱费的规制：2024 年 2 月 26 日《滞期费与滞箱费账单要求》最终规则在《联邦公报》公布；2026 年 7 月 8 日哥伦比亚特区联邦上诉法院维持了 FMC 的一项决定，标题即为&quot;滞期费必须促进货物流畅&quot;（来源：fmc.gov）。这与预约模型相关，是因为<strong>滞期费的起算与免除很大程度上取决于&quot;货主是否被给予了合理的提箱机会&quot;</strong>，而预约时段的可获得性正是&quot;合理机会&quot;的直接证据——这让预约日志从运营数据升级为合规证据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"放号引擎的数据模型与事件契约\">放号引擎的数据模型与事件契约</h2><p>适配层之下是预约引擎的四张表加一条事件流：<strong>营业日历</strong>（哪些日期/班次开闸）、<strong>时段定义</strong>（窗口、片长、基准容量）、<strong>配额配置</strong>（主体 → 预留额度 → 生效日）、<strong>预约实例</strong>（每次占位的凭证）；事件流记录预约全生命周期——创建、确认、改约、取消、履约、逾期、作废。这条事件流的价值远超&quot;操作日志&quot;，它是唯一能回答三个问题的数据源：<strong>放号是否合理</strong>（放号量与实际到港量的偏离）、<strong>分配是否公平</strong>（各主体预约成功率与履约率分布）、<strong>系统是否被滥用</strong>（同一主体高频创建-取消模式）。按主体与时段做二维聚合，就得到履约率、无效率（no-show rate）与重约率，三者构成配额反馈调整的输入。</p>\n<p>由于预约没有统一行业报文，实践解法是把异构码头封装在<strong>适配层</strong>之后：对上层 TMS 暴露统一的&quot;查询可用时段 / 创建预约 / 取消预约 / 查询凭证&quot;四类操作，对下层各码头（自建门户、eModal、终端门户）各自实现。DCSA 把港口挂靠（Port Call）归入&quot;船舶航程&quot;标准组，并强调其标准与 IMO、ISO、UN/CEFACT 框架对齐（来源：dcsa.org），说明航运数据标准化正自下而上收拢，但<strong>卡车预约这一环目前仍主要落在码头私有实现上</strong>；SMDG 的终端代码表与终端活动代码表恰好为&quot;哪个码头、做了什么动作&quot;提供可对齐的公共编码，是归一化的现成抓手（来源：smdg.org）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[TMS 调度请求] --&gt; B[统一预约适配层]&#10;  B --&gt; C{码头适配器}&#10;  C --&gt; D1[自建门户 API]&#10;  C --&gt; D2[eModal 平台 API]&#10;  C --&gt; D3[终端门户 API]&#10;  D1 --&gt; E[预约引擎: 查询/创建/取消]&#10;  D2 --&gt; E&#10;  D3 --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[(预约实例表)]&#10;  E --&gt; G[(事件流)]&#10;  G --&gt; H[履约率/无效率/重约率]&#10;  H --&gt; I[配额反馈调整]&#10;  I --&gt; E\">flowchart LR\n  A[TMS 调度请求] --&gt; B[统一预约适配层]\n  B --&gt; C{码头适配器}\n  C --&gt; D1[自建门户 API]\n  C --&gt; D2[eModal 平台 API]\n  C --&gt; D3[终端门户 API]\n  D1 --&gt; E[预约引擎: 查询/创建/取消]\n  D2 --&gt; E\n  D3 --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[(预约实例表)]\n  E --&gt; G[(事件流)]\n  G --&gt; H[履约率/无效率/重约率]\n  H --&gt; I[配额反馈调整]\n  I --&gt; E</pre><p>图中有一个刻意的闭环：<strong>事件流喂养的指标反过来调整配额</strong>。没有它，预约系统就退化成静态名额表，既无法感知真实需求，也无法约束占位行为。闭环通常按日（配额日调）而非按次，避免策略抖动；每次调整都应留下可解释记录，因为配额直接关系货主服务体验，无记录的自动调额一旦被质疑，系统将失去公信力。模型设计上两个易错点值得点出：其一，<strong>把&quot;时段容量&quot;与&quot;放号量&quot;当成同一个量</strong>——容量是物理上限，放号量是带安全系数的可分配量，混用会导致要么长期空转、要么持续过载；其二，<strong>不区分&quot;晚到&quot;与&quot;无法履约&quot;</strong>——晚到是边界效应，应走偏倚窗口，无法履约是主体行为，应计入履约率并反馈配额，把两者一律判为 no-show 会误伤正常车队并污染反馈信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>码头预约的本质是把&quot;到港时间&quot;改造成受约束的时间配额资源，围绕它的四层抽象是本文主线：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>窗口 → 时间片 → 配额 → 放号规则</strong>：资源侧与分配侧必须分离建模，混在一起就无法解释放号异常。</li>\n<li><strong>片容量由闸口能力反推，但须对堆场能力与到达波动折减</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>slot</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>slot</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{slot}} = \\lfloor N_g T_{\\text{slot}} / t_s \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">slot</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">slot</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span> 只是上限，实际放号量要乘安全系数。</li>\n<li><strong>纯 FIFO 会导致抢号垄断，配额与分批放号是对抗机制</strong>：配额是随履约行为反馈调整的状态量，不是静态常量。</li>\n<li><strong>双重交易必须作为耦合的时段对分配</strong>，且依赖海关放行、放箱状态与空箱池可用性等跨层前置条件。</li>\n<li><strong>预约日志既是运营数据也是合规证据</strong>：在 OSRA 与 FMC 滞期费规制框架下，&quot;是否给过合理提箱机会&quot;直接由预约可获得性证明。</li>\n<li><strong>异构码头需要统一适配层</strong>：预约无统一行业报文，SMDG 终端代码表与 DCSA 的标准对齐方向是可复用的归一化抓手。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话收束：把预约系统建成一张名额表很容易，把它建成一个能感知真实需求、约束占位行为、并留下可审计证据的闭环系统，才是短驳工程里真正难的部分。下一节将展开这套模型如何与提还箱窗口的具体作业约束衔接，见同章 <a href=\"./\">提还箱窗口与作业约束</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"码头预约时段与配额模型：窗口资源、时间片与放号规则的抽象","id":"码头预约时段与配额模型-窗口资源-时间片与放号规则的抽象"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：预约窗口是一种受约束的时间配额资源","id":"核心概念-预约窗口是一种受约束的时间配额资源"},{"level":2,"text":"时间片建模：把连续作业时间切成可分配离散单元","id":"时间片建模-把连续作业时间切成可分配离散单元"},{"level":2,"text":"配额与放号规则：产能、公平性与反占位","id":"配额与放号规则-产能-公平性与反占位"},{"level":2,"text":"双重运输与双重交易的窗口耦合","id":"双重运输与双重交易的窗口耦合"},{"level":2,"text":"放号引擎的数据模型与事件契约","id":"放号引擎的数据模型与事件契约"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"集卡承运商资质、运力池与短驳合同条款的工程化建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/port-drayage-truck-appointment-container-dispatch-system/drayage-network-operating-model/motor-carrier-qualification-contract"},"next":{"title":"双重运输与街转（street turn）匹配引擎：机会约束下的成本最优配对","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/port-drayage-truck-appointment-container-dispatch-system/terminal-appointment-window-scheduling/dual-transaction-street-turn-engine"}}